WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.540
German Democratic Republic 
Oder-Neisse Absolute Defense Line

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:06.730
The 309th TSF Squadron is engaging BETA wave 17

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.190
at point 4-K, in the northeast.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.750
The Werewolf Battalion is to 
provide immediate support.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.200
Stasi HQ to Werewolf Battalion.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:19.660
Rebel forces are gathering in the 
Oranienburg area, near the Havel River.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.940
They cannot be allowed any closer to Berlin.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.760
Deal with them at once.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.880
German Democratic Republic 
Fort Seelow

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:32.760
What the...

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.280
Werewolf, what are you doing?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.140
Come in.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.390
What's wrong? What happened?

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.730
The Werewolf Battalion 
has left the battlefield.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:41.770
They're heading for Berlin.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:43.170
Again?

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.650
They have no intention of 
maintaining the battle lines?

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.990
Werewolf, roger.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.400
Heading for Berlin.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.280
Send the Borkwalde Squad on ahead of us.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.010
Major, they're all dead.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.880
I see... Those girls are dead.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:36.380
German Democratic Republic 
Oranienburg, Revolutionary Army Temporary Command Post

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:51.140
Well done, Comrade Theodor Eberbach.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.310
You've proven your innocence 
with your own hands.

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:55.730
You...

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.990
Now, no one will doubt your loyalty.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.120
I'm counting on you to ensure 
the success of our revolution.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.120
Lise...

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.180
<i>I...</i>

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.460
<i>I forgive you.</i>

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.740
<i>Even if the rest of the world doesn't,</i>

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.270
<i>I forgive you.</i>

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:54.770
<i>She... Ursula Strachwitz... 
was your trump card, wasn't she?</i>

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.840
<i>I promise I'll explain that 
the rebels are in the right,</i>

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.610
<i>and win the government to your side.</i>

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.120
Ursula Strachwitz,

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.750
there is something I want you to do.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:15.240
Yes, sir.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.480
Lise...

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.070
Lise told me.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:27.240
Kaulsdorf Prison in East Berlin...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.010
Irisdina is there.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:39.130
We will now bring our entire 
force into East Berlin.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.610
Many of our comrades will likely die.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:44.380
But if we do not rise now,

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:49.010
East Germany and the East German 
people are doomed.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:53.320
You are our trump card. 
We're counting on all of you.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:05.800
Lieutenant, the Werewolf Battalion's 
been brought back to Berlin.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.280
What about the front lines?

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:12.370
Only the fortress and remaining forces are left.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.340
So we have to fight the 
bulk of Werewolf's troops...

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.770
It'll be fine, Lily.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.560
If we all work together, we won't lose to anyone.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.150
Because...

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.260
The goddess of victory has told us so.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:49.780
I assume full responsibility for the massive 
loss of life this mission will entail.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:54.290
But for East Germany to be reborn...

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.280
Victory to Operation St. Ursula.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:07.670
Germany Democratic Republic 
Somewhere

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.670
I'm surprised, though.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.850
When you first made contact with me, 
I thought it was a joke.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.300
Thank you for your help.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.380
I'm sure she'll be quite happy.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.250
Take care of that other matter for me.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.570
Lieutenant Colonel, the revolutionary
army has begun its advance.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.580
Outskirts of Berlin 
Havel River's Eastern Shore

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:36.200
Picking up something at two o'clock.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.580
It's Werewolf!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:41.080
Draw them as far as you can.

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:53.640
All units, drop!

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.940
The rebels...

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.060
Right, it's time.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:14.780
Hit them!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.060
Roger!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.940
East Berlin

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:26.250
No one recognized the adult Hans.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:30.260
But his mother alone greeted him with:

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:33.510
"Welcome back, Hans."

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.100
What's that smoke?

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.560
What is it, Daddy?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.610
It's coming from the Havel River.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.150
Damn it! Those mechs are 
supposed to be obsolete!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.000
All units destroyed!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.250
All right! Head to Berlin!

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:08.900
Reinforcements?

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.650
We'll link up with the ground forces again.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:12.690
Fall back!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.470
That's...

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.790
A red Aligatori...

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.520
Beatrix Brehme...

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.730
Support the TSFs!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.220
What?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:39.410
Tank division is taking fire from the rear.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.900
Where did they come from?

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:49.920
That's...

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.030
Damn it!

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.010
A hidden Stasi base?

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.020
I screwed up!

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.340
Lily!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.600
No, no. Don't interfere with their hunt.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.870
You'll pay for what you did to 
Second Lieutenant Löwith!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.750
Bastard!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.880
Take this!

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:45.760
Damn it!

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:52.630
They're after the Oranienburg command post!

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:53.570
Follow them!

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.320
Are you okay?

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.910
They got my jump unit.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.770
Don't worry about me. Follow Werewolf!

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.140
Comrade Lieutenant!

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:11.340
Just call me "Gretel"...

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:21.970
Oranienburg 
Revolutionary Army Temporary Command Post

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.600
Seventy percent of the tank division is lost!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.730
General, please escape. You can't stay here.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:32.860
A general cannot flee before his troops.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:40.950
Crap, I can't catch up!

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.200
At this rate...

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.830
Enemy incoming!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:52.080
All units, open fire.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:06.160
German Federation Republic 
Kiel Base

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:07.640
To think that General Strachwitz's 
daughter is alive...

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:13.480
I think there's a chance things 
could change, Vice Minister.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:18.240
Revolutions are born in 
the flames of passion, huh?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.990
Well done!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.210
Can we go save them now?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:31.680
I don't know.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:34.880
We may end up intervening in force.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.780
All we can do is—

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:37.710
Battalion leader!

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:41.930
News from the East!

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:48.810
I'll confirm Heim's body.

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.920
Back me up, Katrina.

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.610
Sorry for getting you involved.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:04.030
It's fine. I owed you.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.190
An ambush?

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:14.040
Battalion leader, all units are 
below thirty percent fuel.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.670
There's not enough fuel for a TSF fight.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.240
Fall back and refuel.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.260
All units, withdraw. We're returning to Berlin.

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:30.550
They're falling back?

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:32.410
But General Heim...

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.400
General! General Heim!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:43.910
General!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.680
Answer us!

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.850
Are you the pilots of the 666th?

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.410
Captain Graf!

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.730
The general!

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.700
G-General...

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.720
I-I'm glad you're safe.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:15.110
Please ensure this country's future...

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:28.470
It appears the revolutionary 
army hung in there.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:32.490
Thank you for the rescue, 
Lieutenant Colonel Axmann.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:39.000
Now, we will recover that important thing, 
as planned, but what will you do?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.370
I'll go with you.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.510
Then the revolution isn't over yet?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:50.790
If it looks like he'll lose, he will surrender 
to spare his men's lives.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.080
That is who Heim is.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.040
If he isn't doing that,

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.890
he must still have something 
up his sleeve, right?

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:00.810
I don't know.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:06.670
East Berlin 
Prenzlauer Berg, Sewers

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:11.910
I didn't know the sewers had corridors like this.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.360
They date back to the sixteenth century.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:18.190
This is how we managed to stay hidden.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:21.170
We can get close to Berlin Tower.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.320
Comrade Major,

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:28.700
East Berlin 
Stasi HQ

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.230
the commander is calling.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.360
Understood.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.240
Here.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:32.970
All right.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.700
Congratulations on your victory, Commander.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:53.150
It's thanks to you.

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.350
Now the country will be at peace.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:59.480
May I ask something?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.000
What is it?

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:06.960
How do you intend to protect this country?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:11.700
East Berlin 
Volkspark Friedrichshain

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.480
A flak tower?

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.730
Is this really it?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:27.800
How will I protect this country?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.990
That's simple.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.740
I'll borrow nuclear weapons from the Soviets.

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:38.070
With nukes, we won't have to 
kill our soldiers needlessly.

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:42.040
You're aware, of course, that nukes 
are ineffective against the BETA?

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.100
We only need to eliminate the smaller ones.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:47.100
You'll protect the nation

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:51.510
with the hateful weapons that burned human 
flesh, and polluted our land and air?

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:57.130
I'm willing to do whatever it takes 
to protect this country.

00:15:57.630 --> 00:16:01.390
I love my country more than anyone.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:08.320
And which country is that, Commander Schmidt?

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.620
I mean...

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:16.780
Special Second Lieutenant Gregory Andropov, 
of the KGB's First Chief Directorate?

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:24.000
You really are a talented hunting dog.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.590
Allow me to introduce you.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.030
These are the Stasi Files.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.910
This?

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:49.240
This place contains the shame of 
not only East Germany, but all Europe.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.380
What do you think?

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.610
A country woven not of trust or law,

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.620
but of spying and violence...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.120
This is my Fatherland, East Germany?

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.520
It's ready, Lieutenant Colonel.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.380
Begin!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.360
What are you doing?

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:19.100
All the important information 
has been copied here.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:23.730
It took two years to do it without 
Schmidt finding out, though.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:30.740
To you, East Germany is a tool 
to protect the Soviet Union?

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.280
Bait to draw away the BETA?

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.400
You think you can get away with that?

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:39.490
This country belongs to me.

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:42.620
It was a pleasure having you work for me.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:46.120
Farewell, Comrade Major.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:51.000
You intended to betray the Stasi?!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.670
Betray? Not at all.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.470
You should help Beatrix, too.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.970
She is the one who will lead this country.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:09.180
Beatrix is very impressed with your capabilities.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:14.430
Let us make a new country together, Gretel.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:21.020
I am the Schwarzesmarken's political commissar,

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.740
Gretel Jeckeln.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:26.590
I won't give in to you damned Stasi!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.370
I see...

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:34.410
You proved quite the disappointment.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.340
It's a real shame.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.410
The rebels?

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.020
The discs!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.330
How did you...

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.900
The flak tower is surrounded.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.130
All pilots are equipped with one.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.410
Prepare to die, Heinze Axmann!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.570
Lieutenant Colonel...

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.200
Lieutenant!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.830
I'm fine. Don't let Axmann escape!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.930
What's with these?

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.650
These things are supposed to be bulletproof.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:25.630
That's the problem with East German equipment.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.350
But I finally...

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:34.420
succeeded in fighting a battle worthy of a pilot...

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.230
Right?

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:47.340
Werewolf...

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:51.280
Until we defeat Beatrix Brehme,

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.620
this battle will never end.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:58.130
But can I protect our last light?

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:01.310
You guys ready?

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.790
Chief mechanic.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.170
I have something for you.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:06.280
This way.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.930
The squad emblem!

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:13.900
Thank you!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.380
You use this one.

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.330
Me?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.650
You're facing the latest tech, right?

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:26.200
This is a modified version of a MiG-23 
I recovered, with a MiG-21PF head.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.870
It combines the units of Miss 
Iris and your little sister.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.250
You could call it the "Cheburashka Zwei."

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:36.490
I assembled it fast, but I guarantee it'll work.

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:38.170
You can do this.

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:39.960
Theodor,

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.660
you command the squad.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.680
The comrade captain would have wanted that.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:48.930
Understood.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:52.360
Someday, tell me

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:58.400
about the things you and Iris went through.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.650
You never used to care about others.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.900
Neither did you.

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:19.420
This is the Schwarzesmarken temporary 
commander, Theodor Eberbach.

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:22.960
This will probably be our last mission.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:27.720
To take hold of the future of 
this country, our tomorrow...

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.970
I want your help.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.990
We can do this.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:38.230
666th TSF squadron, take off!

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:15.080
East Berlin 
Kaulsdorf Prison

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:17.520
Schmidt is dead.

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:21.830
Now we only need to wipe out 
the last remnants of the rebellion.

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:26.610
I shall make Jürgen's ideals a reality.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:30.860
Your goal isn't what my brother 
would have wanted.

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:32.490
Isn't it?

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:35.750
Then I shall prove which of us is right.

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.130
Will you?

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:42.120
The pilots I trained are strong.

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:46.440
I'll crush them.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:51.780
<i>I, Beatrix Brehme, Commander of the Stasi.</i>

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>To Be Continued</b>
